# Vendored upstream sources are kept byte-identical to the signed release
# tarballs they came from, and the READMEs next to them document a verification
# recipe that says so: unpack the tarball, drop the same directories, diff -r.
# End-of-line conversion would break that on any platform that checks out CRLF,
# so it is switched off for those trees. Our own files beside them (README.md,
# the wrapper CMakeLists) stay ordinary text.
thirdparty/freetype/freetype-*/** -text
thirdparty/brotli/brotli-*/**     -text
thirdparty/msdfgen/msdfgen-*/**   -text
